description = "Week 7 supervised sprint — the trainee endpoint filters Student directly by classroom, but Classroom is related through StudentProfile. The current query returns no matching classroom records. Ticket #151 is your first major backend feature: fix the reverse lookup so the endpoint can serialize the classroom roster."
